{color.GG}AVALLSI {color.N}lists available LLSI modules, making it easier to discover registered and unregistered runtime modules.

Usage: {color.GG}avallsi {color.CC}[--only <path>] [--fullscan]{color.N}

Example:
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avallsi{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avallsi {color.CC}--only lib/std/shell{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avallsi {color.CC}--fullscan{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avallsi {color.CC}--only lib/std/shell --fullscan{color.N}